WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Here we go. The drive up to the lake.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That van got us everywhere that summer.

3
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The cabin. Same as it ever was.

4
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Campfire, first night.

5
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
[Guitar playing]

6
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Everybody in!

7
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.000
[Laughter and splashing]

8
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.500
Even the dog went in.

9
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Last paddle before dark.
